    title: "Opening a Bank Account in Portugal as a Foreigner: What You Usually Need",
    excerpt: "General guidance on opening a bank account in Portugal as a foreigner, including the NIF tax number, proof of address and how to choose between banks.",
    category: "banking",
    tags: ["portugal", "bank account abroad", "nif", "expat banking", "foreigner"],
    date: "2026-11-01",
